<BlogLayout title={title} description={description} image={image} canonical={canonical} author="David Chan" authorBio="David Chan is a tax professional specializing in property and rental income taxation in Hong Kong. He assists landlords with IRD compliance, statutory deductions, and tax optimization." lastUpdated="August 2026" readTime="12 min read">
